<title>USA: BT Financial sets 10 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>BT Financial sets 10 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JOHNSTOWN, Pa. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Financial Corp said on Wednesday it declared a 10 percent stock dividend, payable October 22 to shareholders of record September 20, 1996.</p>
<p>This stock dividend will increase the common capital of the company from $25.8 million to $28.4 million with 5,682,215 total shares outstanding. Each shareholder will receive an additional 1/10th share for each share owned and will be paid for all fractional shares, BT Financial said.</p>
</text>
